631
00:49:30,800 --> 00:49:33,119
[SPEAKER_01] Volim da, znate, potpuno ovisi o njima.

632
00:49:33,440 --> 00:49:34,400
[SPEAKER_01] Znate, to je vrlo jednostavan način.

633
00:49:34,480 --> 00:49:35,440
